sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser React SPA
    participant A as App /auth
    participant I as Customer IdP
    participant D as Postgres

    B->>A: GET /auth/login
    A->>B: 302 redirect to IdP with auth URL and PKCE
    B->>I: GET auth URL
    I->>B: Login and MFA prompt
    B->>I: Credentials
    I->>B: 302 to /auth/callback with code
    B->>A: GET /auth/callback with code
    A->>I: POST /token with code and PKCE verifier
    I->>A: id_token and access_token
    A->>A: Verify id_token via JWKS
    A->>D: Upsert user and load app roles
    A->>A: Mint session JWT
    A->>B: Set-Cookie session_jwt then 302 /app
    B->>A: Subsequent calls with cookie
    A->>A: Validate session JWT on each request
    A->>B: 200 OK
